WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.333
Hello! It’s the Number Trail.

2
00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:08.667
Toto runs. Look! One star.

3
00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:13.000
How many flowers? Two flowers.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.333
Leo counts. Three balls.

5
00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:21.667
Mia counts. Four leaves.

6
00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:26.000
Emma counts. Five apples.

7
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.333
The signs go on: six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

8
00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:34.667
More signs: eleven, twelve, thirteen, fourteen, fifteen.

9
00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:39.000
Final signs: sixteen, seventeen, eighteen, nineteen, twenty.

10
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.333
How many flags? Twenty flags.

11
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:47.667
Toto is happy.

12
00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:52.000
Goodbye, Number Trail!

